# Commit changes

After any change to this project, commit it. Do not ask first.

- Commit when the change is complete and checks that apply have been run.
- Do not push unless asked.
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, service account keys).
- Do not change git config, skip hooks, or force-push.
- If a hook rejects the commit, fix the problem and make a new commit.
